  "instructions": [
    "preheat your oven to 375°f (190°c).",
    "toast the bread until lightly browned.",
    "in a large bowl, whisk together sesame oil, soy sauce, rice vinegar, sugar, and garlic.",
    "add the sliced mushrooms to the marinade and let it sit for at least 10 minutes.",
    "heat a skillet over medium heat and cook the marinated mushrooms until they're tender and lightly browned.",
    "assemble the ssam by placing a slice of toasted bread on a flat surface, then add a few pieces of the cooked mushrooms, some green onions, and a sprinkle of crushed toasted sesame seeds.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
